@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Import preview, explicit suggestions and human review/save
hide footbox
autonumber
actor User
participant "Imports / EntryEditor\n<<React functions>>" as Web
participant "import_api / imports\n<<functions>>" as Imports
participant "service : GeminiService" as AI
participant "dataset API / collection\n<<functions>>" as Collection

activate User
User -> Web : Preview selected file
activate Web
Web -> Imports : POST /api/imports/preview\nmultipart file + consent flag
activate Imports
note over Imports : Bound multipart stream; validate format and size.\nClose upload resources in finally.
Imports -> Imports : preview_file(...)\nlocal extraction or media validation
activate Imports
alt Supported readable local document
  note over Imports : Parse text / structured rows / DOCX / PDF.\nImported approval flags are discarded.
else Media / no text / consented partial-PDF OCR
  alt Explicit cloud consent
    Imports -> AI : await _generate(file inline, structured=False)
    activate AI
    AI --> Imports : Unreviewed transcript or AIError
    deactivate AI
  else No consent
    note over Imports : Reject required cloud processing; no provider call.
  end
end
Imports --> Imports : Bounded text, drafts and warnings / error
deactivate Imports
Imports --> Web : ImportPreview or safe HTTP error
deactivate Imports
Web --> User : Editable segments and warnings; nothing saved
deactivate Web

opt User explicitly requests AI entry suggestions
  User -> Web : Generate suggestions
  activate Web
  Web -> Imports : POST /api/imports/suggest\nreviewed segment + language
  activate Imports
  Imports -> AI : await _generate(..., structured=False)
  activate AI
  AI --> Imports : Candidate JSON or AIError
  deactivate AI
  note over Imports : Validate <=12 unreviewed drafts;\nexact word-bounded quotations, no invented source text.
  Imports --> Web : SuggestionResponse / error; no save
  deactivate Imports
  Web --> User : Candidates requiring review
  deactivate Web
end

opt A candidate exists and the user chooses to save it
User -> Web : Review candidate, then explicitly Save
activate Web
note over Web : EntryEditor starts unreviewed; human edits\nlanguage/glosses/provenance and review decision.
Web -> Collection : POST /api/dataset\nEntryCreate
activate Collection
note over Collection : Validate, reject duplicate if needed;\nlocked atomic mutation (storage sequence).
Collection --> Web : 201 DatasetEntry / actionable error
deactivate Collection
Web --> User : Saved status only on success; draft on failure
deactivate Web
end
deactivate User
legend bottom
  Translate/Ask AI handoff fills a draft only (no network/save side effect).
  Original imports are not retained as collection attachments by the application.
  Permission and manual fieldwork authenticity cannot be supplied by software.
endlegend
@enduml
